1.1 Requirements
================

Emacs 29.1 or later, and mpv on your ‘PATH’ (or set
‘subtle-mpv-executable’).  subtle talks to mpv through its JSON IPC
socket, so Windows is not supported.


File: subtle.info,  Node: Starting and stopping,  Next: Autoscroll,  Prev: Requirements,  Up: Overview

1.2 Starting and stopping
=========================

   • ‘M-x subtle-open’ asks for a media file and one or two subtitle
     files.
   • ‘M-x subtle-dired-open’ does the same from Dired: it uses the
     marked files, or the file at point, and finds missing subtitles by
     file name (‘film.mkv’, ‘film.sl.srt’).
   • ‘q’ closes what is open on screen (a popup, the help box), and with
     nothing open asks whether to quit.  ‘M-x subtle-close’ ends the
     session without asking.
   • ‘M-x bookmark-set’ in a subtle buffer records the media, subtitles
     and time.  Jumping to the bookmark (‘subtle-bookmark-jump’) reopens
     them ‘subtle-bookmark-rewind’ seconds earlier, paused unless
     ‘subtle-bookmark-autoplay’ is set.


File: subtle.info,  Node: Autoscroll,  Next: Layouts,  Prev: Starting and stopping,  Up: Overview

1.3 Autoscroll
==============

Autoscroll moves the window only when the spoken cue is off screen or
has entered a page margin.  Pausing, resizing the window, or the
automatic resume never move the text by themselves.  Scrolling by hand
stops the autoscroll and shows a notice; it resumes after
‘subtle-resume-delay’ seconds (if ‘subtle-auto-resume’ is on) or when
you press ‘r’.


File: subtle.info,  Node: Layouts,  Prev: Autoscroll,  Up: Overview

1.4 Layouts
===========

‘subtle-layout’ decides how cues are arranged.

Layout              Meaning
---------------------------------------------------------------
‘single-spaced’     one cue per line (default)
‘double-spaced’     a blank line between cues
‘sentence’          a line break after each sentence
‘paragraph-flow’    running text, broken at paragraph breaks
‘paragraph-pause’   like flow; playback pauses at each break

   Paragraph breaks come from blank lines or empty cues in the file and,
when ‘subtle-paragraph-source’ is ‘explicit-and-gap’, from silences of
‘subtle-paragraph-gap’ seconds after a sentence end.


