3 Options
*********

Set an option with ‘setopt’ (or Customize) and a running session changes
at once for the options that can: layout, text size, fill columns and
the notice style.  The rest are read when they are used.  ‘s o’
(‘subtle-set-option’) asks for an option and a value and sets it for the
rest of the Emacs session; it is a thin wrapper over
‘customize-set-variable’.

