3.1 Playback
============

Option                          Default                                                      Meaning
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
‘subtle-mpv-executable’         "mpv"                                                        The mpv program.
‘subtle-mpv-base-args’          see below                                                    Arguments always given to mpv.
‘subtle-mpv-extra-args’         nil                                                          Your own additional mpv arguments.
‘subtle-mpv-connect-timeout’    3.0                                                          Seconds to wait for mpv's socket.
‘subtle-keep-focus’             t                                                            Keep mpv from taking the keyboard focus.
‘subtle-video’                  auto                                                         ‘never’ plays audio only.
‘subtle-seek-small’             5                                                            Seconds skipped by the small seek keys.
‘subtle-seek-big’               30                                                           Seconds skipped by the big seek keys.
‘subtle-speed-step’             0.25                                                         Change per faster or slower.
‘subtle-speed-range’            (0.25 .  4.0)                                                Slowest and fastest speed.
‘subtle-previous-cue-restart’   1.0                                                          Within this many seconds of a cue's start, previous cue goes to the one before; later, it restarts this cue.
‘subtle-hold-last-cue’          t                                                            Keep the last cue highlighted in a silent gap.
‘subtle-confirm-quit’           t                                                            Ask before quitting.
‘subtle-bookmark-rewind’        3                                                            Seconds a bookmark jump goes back.
‘subtle-bookmark-autoplay’      nil                                                          Non-nil starts playing when a bookmark opens; nil opens it paused.
‘subtle-media-extensions’       mp3 m4a flac wav ogg opus aac wma mp4 mkv webm mov avi m4v   Offered when picking media.
‘subtle-subtitle-extensions’    ("srt" "vtt")                                                Recognised as subtitles.

   The base arguments are ‘"--no-terminal" "--sub-auto=no" "--sid=no"
"--keep-open=yes" "--audio-display=no"’.  Leave them alone unless you
know why; add your own through ‘subtle-mpv-extra-args’:

     (setopt subtle-mpv-extra-args '("--volume=60" "--af=scaletempo2"))


