7.1 Public API
==============

Name                               What it gives
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
‘subtle-current-session’           the open session, or nil
‘subtle-active-p’                  non-nil while a session is open
‘subtle-session-buffers’           accessor: the subtitle buffers of a session
‘subtle-session-pairs’             the (BUFFER .  INDEX) of each live buffer
‘subtle-cue-span’                  the (BEG .  END) of cue INDEX in BUFFER
‘subtle-held-p’                    non-nil while something holds the text still
‘subtle-played-start-position’     where the latest continuous playback began, in this buffer
‘subtle-played-through-position’   where it has reached; seeking does not move it
‘subtle-popup-make-frame’          an invisible child frame showing a box
‘subtle-set-option’                set an option for this session
‘subtle-mode-map’                  the keymap; add your keys here

   The variables ‘subtle-track-index’ and ‘subtle-language’ are set in
every subtitle buffer.


